<title>CHINA: Shanghai May GDP up 13.7 percent year-on-year.</title>
<headline>Shanghai May GDP up 13.7 percent year-on-year.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai's gross domestic product (GDP) rose 13.7 percent to 28.41 billion yuan in May compared with the same month in 1996, local television said on Friday.</p>
<p>The city's GDP was 26.582 billion yuan in April, up 15.6 percent from April 1996, the official media has reported.</p>
<p>($1=8.3 yuan)</p>
<p>-- Shanghai newsroom (86-21) 6279-7004</p>
